  gossip in 24 h with no false alert. Gauge names unchanged
  (`aitbc_island_gossip_silence_seconds` still measures import silence);
  expressions, thresholds and `for:` values unchanged. promtool
  check + test green on node2 (island section; two BridgeSet failures
  pre-exist on main).
